      <comment>
       <narrative xml:lang="EN">Annual engagement with CEDAW and CRPD treaty bodies</narrative>
      </comment>
     </target>
     <actual value="2">
      <location ref="Global"></location>
      <comment>
       <narrative xml:lang="EN">IWRAW AP led WGG in the submission of a written statement to the CEDAW Committee on the new General Recommendation 40 on equal and inclusive representation of women in decision-making systems. IWRAW AP also read out an oral statement at CEDAW 84th session in Geneva. The thematic focus of the submission was on the experiences and barriers faced by women with disabilities, and structural, political and legal changes needed to ensure their entry, and participation in decision-making systems at all levels</narrative>
      </comment>
     </actual>
    </period>
